sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant U as Uploader
  participant V as Validator
  participant A as Albums
  participant S as PhotoStore
  C->>U: upload(albumId, file)
  U->>V: check(file)
  V-->>U: problem or null
  alt file accepted
    U->>A: find(albumId)
    A-->>U: album
    U->>S: save(id, bytes)
    U->>A: save(album)
    U-->>C: photo
  else file refused
    U-->>C: Rejected
  end
